00:16:00.886 --> 00:16:01.886
apply it to a problem.

00:16:01.886 --> 00:16:02.886
Rinse and repeat and suddently you are understanding
all sort of stuff you didn't think you would

00:16:02.886 --> 00:16:03.886
be!

00:16:03.886 --> 00:16:04.886
I've been using Brilliant, and you should
go try it out just to see how facinating it

00:16:04.886 --> 00:16:05.886
is that such complex subjects can be so easily
